WEBVTT

00:02:56.205 --> 00:03:00.937
And they did it in a total devotion to non-violence.

00:03:00.937 --> 00:03:08.104
They realized that using force against force

00:03:08.104 --> 00:03:13.300
doesn't work.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.493
So what does work?

00:03:15.493 --> 00:03:18.962
Over time I've collected about a half-dozen methods

00:03:18.962 --> 00:03:20.795
that do work -- of course there are many more --

00:03:20.795 --> 00:03:23.141
that do work and that are effective.

00:03:23.141 --> 00:03:24.508
And the first is

00:03:24.508 --> 00:03:27.026
that the change that has to take place

00:03:27.026 --> 00:03:31.491
has to take place here, inside me.